      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Klepto is a 2003 straight-to-DVD independent thriller film starring Meredith Bishop and Jsu Garcia. It is the debut film of director Thomas Trail and premiered at the 2003 CineVegas Film Festival.",
