    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Meredith Anne Bishop (born January 15, 1976) is an American actress. She is perhaps best known for her role as Annie Mack in Nickelodeon's \"The Secret World of Alex Mack\", which ran on the network from 1994-1998.",
